    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. My name is Judy. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096124500000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Judy, I need to make a return. It's for the new VeloBand GPS Tracker.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92214,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096129566666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Can I get your name or order number to pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096134566666
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, the name is Alex Chen.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92214,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096141166666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. One moment... Okay, I see your account. I also see you're a VIP member with us. We really appreciate your business.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096143233332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks. So, can I return this band?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92214,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768096152233332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I see here it was delivered about 26 days ago, which is well within the **90 days** we allow for returns. So that's **no problem** at all.",
